   "source": [
    "## Sigma0 (ellipsoid)\n",
    "\n",
    "The sigma0 workflow is identical, except for the coefficient and the target collection.\n",
    "For sigma0 we use `implementation_version` 3 of the backscatter processing, \n",
    "which is selected through the `options` of `sar_backscatter`. "
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 6,
   "id": "58e95798",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "sigma0 = monthly_composite(\"sigma0-ellipsoid\", options={\"implementation_version\": \"3\"})"
   ]
  },
